# Design System

Before creating or modifying frontend UI, read **`DESIGN.MD`** at the repository root.

Rules:
- Follow color tokens, typography, spacing, and component patterns defined there
- Use CSS variables from `frontend/src/app/globals.css` — do not invent new hex colors
- Use `card-zen`, `stagger-reveal`, `bg-zen-gradient`, and semantic helpers in `frontend/src/lib/utils.ts`
- Icons: Lucide React only, at sizes documented in DESIGN.MD
- When you introduce a new reusable visual pattern, update `DESIGN.MD` in the same change
